@baseUrl = https://localhost:7043
@apiCredential = REPLACE_WITH_A_VALID_API_CREDENTIAL

### Check the third-party client's identity and granted scopes.
# Obtain the credential from the authenticated Administrator page and store it securely.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access
Authorization: Bearer {{apiCredential}}

### Missing or revoked credentials return 401.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access
